        "text": "🤖 <b>connectED Telegram Bot Guide</b>\n\n<b>Supported Commands:</b>\n• /start - Launch bot or link via deep link\n• /link &lt;token&gt; - Manually link with single-use token\n• /status - Check account connection details\n• /unlink - Disconnect your Telegram account\n• /optout - Pause all Telegram notifications\n• /help - View this guide\n\n<b>Mentorship SLA Features:</b>\n• Real-time Accept / Decline inline buttons\n• 48-Hour response deadline alerts\n• Automated fallback mentor matching\n• Meeting scheduling & mutual confirmation",
